  - name: "Learn New Languages Instantly"
    description: "Any new spoken language it encounters is immediately understood at 98% and spoken at 75%, partly psionic and partly a natural gift. This lasts only while the Rulian is in the company of the person speaking that language. Deliberately studying it (60 hours over a two week period) makes it fluent at 90%. The written word is interpreted/translated at 75% efficiency, but learning a new written language starts with the basic literacy skill and a +20% bonus. Over time Rulians speak hundreds of languages and dialects and read scores of them. No I.S.P. cost."
