ing row; the few personal items and an escaped slave''s body armor and tools are prose. || MONEY: slaves start with none, stored as 0. || NOT STORED: size, weight, life span, habitat, value (100,000-150,000 credits), allies and enemies are in the body; the Phase World beginning languages are a note on the six of choice."
